144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (PAM4 \(Pulse-Amplitude Modulation with 4 levels\) allows 2 bits to be transmitted per symbol, doubling data rate without doubling frequency. This helps achieve 64 GT/s per lane in Gen6 while controlling signal loss and crosstalk at very high frequencies.)
/E (PAM4 \(Pulse-Amplitude Modulation with 4 levels\) allows 2 bits to be transmitted per symbol, doubling data rate without doubling frequency. This helps achieve 64 GT/s per lane in Gen6 while controlling signal loss and crosstalk at very high frequencies.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
